-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fujita-health-university-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fujita-health-university-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-12-05T23:59:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:30+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Fujita Health University built a personal health records system on AWS that is compliant with the Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources (FHIR) standard and capable of supporting one million patients.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Fujita_Health_University_logo%401x.532c1bd16b0732499cae806fb78835ce842d7009.png","displayLocation":"Japan","customerNameLower":"fujita health university","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-12-05","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/fujita-health-university-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Fujita Health University","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Fujita Health University Aims to Improve Continuity of Patient Care and Deliver Higher Quality Healthcare with Patient Records on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},