celerator","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#gaming","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Gaming","description":"Gaming","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#nordics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Nordics","description":"Nordics","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#godaddy06212022skjnfllksdm","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"godaddy06212022skjnfllksdm","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:16:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-02-08T01:38:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Learn from GoDaddy\u0027s Director of Information Security on Best Practices to enable Agility in a Zero Trust Environment.  Security is in GoDaddy\u0027s DNA and to enable it they practice the zero trust architecture.  GoDaddy took approach that every org is separated and isolated. The Dev accounts are isolated by account boundary. Every account setup has it\u0027s own VPC with isolated subnet and  private IPs. GoDaddy also does node rotation daily with updated Golden AMIs. GoDaddy rotates this from the EC2 instances to the whole EKS clusters. Because they update and rotate the Golden AMI images frequently, GoDaddy never have to patch.  GoDaddy built an OSS tool that runs configuration scans, but also runs scans looking for GoDaddy standards. Another way to stop horizontal movement within the group is that they do not allow VPC peering. The Accounts would talk to each other via NAT Gateway. They can quickly isolate an Account to reduce the blast radius if that Account were to get compromised.  GoDaddy governs the account creation through their Cloud Portal that performs Cloud Readiness Review. The process checks to see if the application follows best practices/standards. Once approved, the application team is onboard through the portal and baseline environment is created with security approved CloudFormation templates. This automation enables GoDaddy to make it easier to spin-up a new account with best practices in an isolated fashion with security built in.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/godaddy-logo%401x.55f195a5ea23b2192ab24c16c8b84db084f0f6b0.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"godaddy.com, inc.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-06-21","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/BgT_bDAejSQ?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Godaddy.com, Inc.","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"GoDaddy: Empowering Agility with Zero-Trust Environment Best Practices","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#network","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#waf","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS WAF","description":"AWS WAF","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#reference-arch-diagram","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Reference Architecture Diagram","description":"Reference Architecture Diagram","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jump","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jump","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:44:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d6Uq9Qvtzitw","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eJump facilite le quotidien des personnes souhaitant devenir freelances en leur proposant de les embaucher en CDI - tout en restant leur propre patron sans avoir \u0026agrave; g\u0026eacute;rer le volet administratif. Sebastian CACERES, CTO chez Jump, partage l\u0026rsquo;ambition de multiplier par 5 le nombre de salari\u0026eacute;s freelances d\u0026rsquo;ici fin 2022. Sa probl\u0026eacute;matique principale : rester proche des clients en proposant une disponibilit\u0026eacute; en continue et une structure pour ses utilisateurs. Le Cloud AWS a su fournir les fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s permettant \u0026agrave; Jump de r\u0026eacute;pondre \u0026agrave; ses besoins de haute disponibilit\u0026eacute;, flexibilit\u0026eacute;, scalabilit\u0026eacute; et de s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; pour un investissement moindre en amont. Le passage au cloud a eu pour effet d\u0026rsquo;offrir plus d\u0026rsquo;agilit\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; Jump en leur permettant de faire du test and learn gr\u0026acirc;ce aux diff\u0026eacute;rentes fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s et services propos\u0026eacute;s. Jump souhaite aller plus loin et s\u0026rsquo;int\u0026eacute;resse aujourd\u0026rsquo;hui \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;architecture bas\u0026eacute;e sur des \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nements, la scalabilit\u0026eacute; et les services \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;chelle mondiale.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Uq9Qvtzitw/maxresdefault.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/%c3%89tude%20de%20cas%20AWS%20%20Jump.ba964f2b5a82506027f093a6dd39620de314eb70.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"jump","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/jump/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jump","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Jump : Une solution innovante pour les freelances en recherche d’une proximité client toujours plus forte"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lightsail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Lightsail","description":"Amazon Lightsail","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:47+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#gamelift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon GameLift","description":"Amazon GameLift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#deep-learning-containers","locale":"en_US",