atch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#indonesia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Indonesia","description":"Indonesia","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#dosm-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"dosm-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-03-24T02:43:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:46:32+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The Department of Statistics Malaysia (DOSM), which collects national economic and social statistics, became the first Malaysian federal government agency to migrate to AWS. The agency needed to conduct Malaysia’s national census for the year 2020, a process that only takes about 3 months, but it needed to maintain its costly on-premises infrastructure year-round. By switching to cloud services, DOSM could use cloud resources only as needed, achieving cost savings for the government and improving scalability. On the cloud, the agency would also gain access to a wide range of AWS services for everything from managing user traffic to strengthening security.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/dosm-logo%401x.73724077506bd78f6fe3e5aaed1f3f09b7754726.png","displayLocation":"Malaysia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2022-03-23","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/dosm-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"DOSM Helps Nine Million Users Access Malaysia Census Data on AWS","customer-name":"Department of Statistics Malaysia"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated"