ards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#gtimexico","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"gtimexico","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Para seguir llevando la calidad y disponibilidad de sus servicios para más de 5,200 clientes, Grupo Tress Internacional migró de una infraestructura on-premises hacia nube privada y, más tarde, hacia nube pública de Amazon Web Services. Como resultado, Grupo Tress sumó mucho más valor a las soluciones y servicios que ofrece al mercado, además de crear una gran cercanía física y digital con sus clientes.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/grupotress_logo%401x.45ebe70b59c8249548e37bc666e15f3f11c8b671.png","displayLocation":"México","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Fabricación","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/gtimexico/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Grupo Tress Internacional","headline":"Grupo Tress Internaci